{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>And you shall raise a tribute for HaShem</b> – This tribute too, because this spoil was from the vengeance of HaShem, belonged not to them. But in the land of Sihon and Og they gave nothing from it to the priests and to the Levites; rather, they were warned concerning it, as it is stated: \"And you shall have no portion among them\" (Numbers 18:20), even in the spoil."], :book :numbers, :voice :ramban, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T04:09:47.711396171Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}